<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian Oct yr/yr inflation 2.1 pct vs Sept 2.0.</title>
<headline>Austrian Oct yr/yr inflation 2.1 pct vs Sept 2.0.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION	   October    September     Oct 1995</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index rise	-0.2	 -0.8	    -0.3</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	     2.1	  2.0	     1.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    131.2	131.5	   128.5</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
